    "description": "Investment Opportunity! Charming and bright Tudor Revival style duplex in the center of the vibrant Richmond district holds two thoughtfully designed and spacious 2BR, 1BA flats with balconies, plus shared garage and back yard. Vintage details include beautiful fireplaces flanked by built-in shelves, bay windows, stucco with crown molding, hardwood floors, and arches. Each unit features an elegant living room, dining room, breakfast nook, kitchen, pantry, multiple storage spaces throughout, bathroom with water closet for maximum privacy, and 2 bedrooms that access a private deck overlooking a lush outdoor space with mature trees in neighboring yards. Large 2-car garage with ample storage and W/D for each unit and the blissful back yard with minimalist landscaping. Nestled between the inner and outer Richmond, one block from the serenity of Golden Gate Park, and a healthy walk to delicious restaurants, cafes, bakeries, and charming shops on Balboa, Geary and Clement."
